{"id":"491788","name":"双雪大骨汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/491788/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"雪耳","amount":"1朵"},{"name":"雪梨","amount":"2个"},{"name":"猪大骨","amount":"750g"}],"sub":[{"name":"无花果干","amount":"5粒"},{"name":"南杏","amount":"5g"},{"name":"北杏","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"雪耳泡发。","img":"images/491788/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去蒂撕小块。","img":"images/491788/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"南北杏洗净。","img":"images/491788/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"猪大骨飞血水，洗净浮沫。","img":"images/491788/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"雪梨去切小块。","img":"images/491788/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"无花果干冲洗一下，对半切开，以便出味。","img":"images/491788/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把所有材料放入电压力锅开煮。","img":"images/491788/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煲好后用隔油网勺撇去肥油，喝起来更健康。","img":"images/491788/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"润肺止咳，补钙又美颜。","img":"images/491788/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}